 "notModeled": [
  "analog input, PGA, reference selection, IDACs, burn-out sources, FIR 50/60 Hz filter, low-side switch (all stored only)",
  "temperature-sensor mode (TS=1): the result is still the 0 V code, not the 14-bit temperature format",
  "conversion times are the single-shot values of Table 8-4 for normal and turbo mode and the continuous values for duty-cycle mode; continuous-mode periods (slightly shorter), the 210/114 tCLK first-conversion delay and the internal-oscillator wake-up (up to 50 us) are not modeled; times assume the internal oscillator or a 4.096 MHz CLK (another external CLK frequency scales them); the CLK pin is not used",
  "entering continuous mode by a WREG of CM=1 does not need START/SYNC in the model (the datasheet requires START/SYNC); a WREG during continuous conversions does not restart the conversion (the datasheet resets the filter and restarts)",
  "POWERDOWN during a conversion: the datasheet completes the conversion first",
  "DRDY pulses high for 2 tMOD before the next result when the previous one was not read",
  "full-duplex command decoding while data are shifted out is approximated by out R{24} plus byte commands; commands are not decoded during an RDATA/RREG reply (datasheet); an RREG/RDATA mid-read corrupting the data",
  "DOUT/DRDY after the 16 data bits drives high (idle '1', Figure 8-31, 16 extra SCLKs, for DRDYM=1); for DRDYM=0 the datasheet does not say",
  "SPI timeout (14000/28000 tMOD) interface reset; CS tied low permanently",
  "RESET command recovery time (50 us + 32 tCLK)",
  "CONFIG3 bit 0 RESERVED is modeled as a plain R/W bit"
